* text=auto eol=lf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.heic binary
*.webp binary
*.tif binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
# A PDF's cross-reference table holds byte offsets: converting line endings would break it.
*.pdf binary
# The licences of the bundled ffmpeg's libraries, kept byte for byte as the build carries them (some upstream files end
# their lines in CRLF): the ffmpeg source workflow compares them with cmp.
installer/notices/ffmpeg/** -text
